{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》昨晚完滿結束，於抽獎環節中，原先由錢嘉樂抽出、贏得獎品連免找數簽帳額總值超過10萬元的黃劍文，因未能在限時現身，結果再抽之下由曹永廉候補抽中。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;黃</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:03:56.007459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:16.109175+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:16.109175+00:00","content_hash":"6add94d875d33731694ef5834d5396a861d67395b47c789ec642a21772f60d00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}